hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16760","He said: Abu Amir narrated to us, he said: Abd Allah ibn Abi Sulayman, a righteous old man of good appearance, a Madinan, narrated to us, he said: Muadh ibn Abd Allah ibn Khubayb narrated to us, from his father, from his uncle, he said: We were in a gathering and the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) came upon us and mentioned it."
